9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"【探班视频】核聚变试玩采访，令玩家直呼“大”的角色是？\">【探班视频】核聚变试玩采访，令玩家直呼“大”的角色是？</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8E%A2%E7%8F%AD%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B8%E8%81%9A%E5%8F%98%E8%AF%95%E7%8E%A9%E9%87%87%E8%AE%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A4%E7%8E%A9%E5%AE%B6%E7%9B%B4%E5%91%BC%E2%80%9C%E5%A4%A7%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：【探班视频】核聚变试玩采访，令玩家直呼“大”的角色是？\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：铃兰之剑摄制组<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2021-11-26 12:10<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FMPIJccMS50lVguhXKfRsgA\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MPIJccMS50lVguhXKfRsgA</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img alt=\"官方消息19.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e2/13ukrbr9hhqa9zk6wju4x2guycj6vmr.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"113\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"113\" />\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息33.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c5/ca66oflcs9d41p2qm5rk2gpp7m4p5a0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"608\" />\n<br /><br /><br />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>11月20日~21日由机核网主办的游戏嘉年华核聚变2021Tour广州站已经结束了，《铃兰之剑》特别荣幸能通过这次展览与各位玩家“面基”。\n<br /><br />\n众所周知，机核网是一个主要以硬核玩家为主的主机游戏平台，而我们是手游，虽然品质在TapTap上得到了认可但是面对这群硬核玩家还是非常的紧张与忐忑。\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%; border:0px; background-color:#ffffff\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"5\" style=\"width:45%; border:2px solide; border-color:#ffffff\"><center><img alt=\"官方消息29.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/17/fqbmtv5jv8v42483dfxnr5y7imn85mn.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"271\" data-file-width=\"200\" data-file-height=\"271\" /></center>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"border-color:#ff8c00; width:80px; height:16px\"><b>小场记</b>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border:0px; height:12px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border:0px; height:4px; background-color:#ffe4e1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-color:#ffe4e1; background-color:#ffe4e1; height:24px\"><br />各位团长好，我是铃兰之剑摄制组的小场记，好久不见，有没有想我呀~\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-color:#ffe4e1; background-color:#ffe4e1; height:16px\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color:#ff8c00; height:16px; width:100px; background-color:#ffe4e1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:0px\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<br /></center>\n<p>这次小场记的任务便是深入群众，倾听民心，认真反馈。对此，我主要从试玩感受、游戏建议、研发期望这三个维度采访了现场玩家。\n<br /><br />\n点击视频，看看他们有没有说到你的心里话。\n</p>\n<br /><br /><br /><center>\n<p><big><big><font color=\"#bdb76b\"><b>点击观看</b></font></big></big><b><br /></b>\n<small><font color=\"#bdb76b\">...............................................................................................................</font></small>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"bvideo\" data-id=\"BV1rR4y1x72X\" data-cid=\"0\" data-page=\"1\" data-title=\"核聚变试玩采访\" data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"280\"></div><br /></center>\n<p>配合时间轴使用更方便观看(＾Ｕ＾)ノ~ＹＯ<br />\n00:00-01:12 玩家谈试玩感受<br />\n01:13-02:30 玩家提游戏建议<br />\n02:42-03:24「 萌萌哒老陈」聊游戏系统<br />\n03:25-03:30「北极熊剩饭」谈试玩感受<br />\n03:31-03:47「女王盐」谈试玩感受<br />\n03:48-04:15 玩家对游戏的祝福<br />\n<br /><br />\n视频中大家集中反馈的几个问题，我也及时与研发进行反馈和沟通。以下是可以确定的答复。<br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%; border:0px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:0px; width:5%; height:296px; background-color:#ffffff\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color:#bdb76b; height:296px\"><center><img alt=\"官方消息34.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/i8176o01by4sxy5pvobv6uu6n0lam56.png/490px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF34.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"276\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/i8176o01by4sxy5pvobv6uu6n0lam56.png/735px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF34.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/i8176o01by4sxy5pvobv6uu6n0lam56.png/980px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF34.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"608\" /></center>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border:0px; width:5%; height:296px; background-color:#ffffff\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color:#bdb76b; color:#ffffff; height:30px\">A：容易误触的问题我们已经解决了很多，下次测试可以明显感受到变化。\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br />\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%; border:0px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:0px; width:5%; height:296px; background-color:#ffffff\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color:#bdb76b; height:296px\"><center><img alt=\"官方消息35.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/3juqokq3f4iq8m1298404zes2yzj2fn.png/490px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF35.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"276\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/3juqokq3f4iq8m1298404zes2yzj2fn.png/735px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF35.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/3juqokq3f4iq8m1298404zes2yzj2fn.png/980px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF35.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"608\" /></center>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border:0px; width:5%; height:296px; background-color:#ffffff\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color:#bdb76b; color:#ffffff; height:50px\">A：核聚变上试玩的是切片版本UI还不完善，目前研发对各种显示和操作一直在优化，我们也会通过测试收集玩家反馈不断改善。\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br />\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%; border:0px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:0px; width:5%; height:296px; background-color:#ffffff\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color:#bdb76b; height:296px\"><center><img alt=\"官方消息36.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/ns72sb4jwzlanwqyg3r6kfgoz1p2kec.png/490px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF36.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"276\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/ns72sb4jwzlanwqyg3r6kfgoz1p2kec.png/735px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF36.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/ns72sb4jwzlanwqyg3r6kfgoz1p2kec.png/980px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF36.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"608\" /></center>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border:0px; width:5%; height:296px; background-color:#ffffff\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color:#bdb76b; color:#ffffff; height:30px\">A：我们会做PC版本，如果一切顺利也会上主机平台，但目前紧要是把手游版本做好。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<br /><br /></center>\n<p>最后还有一个大家最关心的问题——<b>什么时候测试</b>？\n<br /><br />\nA：我们希望产品以更完善的面貌与大家相见，还请再通融一点时间，大概明年<big><big><b>春天会举行一次测试</b></big></big>。\n<br /><br />\n请一直关注TapTap哟，游戏的最新消息都会在TapTap上第一时间同步哒。\n</p>\n<br /><br /><br /><center>\n<p>......................................................<img alt=\"官方消息32.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/11/b2whu9tq2q2lvgp8hjyuzsdbdsaz0r9.gif/50px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF32.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"67\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/11/b2whu9tq2q2lvgp8hjyuzsdbdsaz0r9.gif/75px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF32.gif 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/11/b2whu9tq2q2lvgp8hjyuzsdbdsaz0r9.gif/100px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF32.gif 2x\" data-file-width=\"200\" data-file-height=\"269\" />......................................................\n<img alt=\"官方二维码.png\" src=\"https